<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Limits of this design</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Speech input is English by default.</strong> This line uses the keypad. To let callers speak their choice in another language, add a speech recognizer that supports it and set <code>language</code> on the <code>&lt;Gather&gt;</code>.</li>
		<li><strong>The menu always starts in English.</strong> The first sentence is English for everyone. To start in another language, change the order or the first <code>&lt;Say&gt;</code>.</li>
		<li><strong>One bar for every language.</strong> Each branch rings the same number. To send each language to its own staff, give each branch its own <code>&lt;Number&gt;</code>.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

